# BrandFit: instructions for AI coding assistants
Project: BrandFit, a brand governance web app. Employers create a company
workspace and set brand rules. Employees submit content. An AI reviewer flags
issues and cites a rule. Creators accept, edit or reject. Reviewers approve.
Stack: Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind, Supabase (Postgres +
Auth), Google Gemini API via @google/genai, deployed on Vercel.
